    "title": "Viral PopUp Bagels Snags Lafayette's Old Taco Bell Spot - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tony Ng ,\n13 hours ago PopUp Bagels, the viral bagel chain that bills itself as not famous but known, is rolling into Lafayette this fall and taking over the former Taco Bell downtown. The new shop is slated for the high-visibility corner at 3501 Mount Diablo Blvd, where renderings show PopUp's logo stepping in for the retired bell arch, setting up a pretty noticeable shift in the morning landscape for commuters and families. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
